  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-02-12T05:48:57.738Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I believe the notifications inside of the inbox itself should not expire until an action is performed on them so that way any unchecked notifications won't be missed once they disappear but the expiration time should be kept for the HUD and QM notifications. Purpose of this could be for if you wanna hold onto an invite or invite request.",
